sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015) & Park et al. (2015) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming & asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition — MorphoEval overall 54.2/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 1 (v1) evaluation of `2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py` (57.3/100). The v1 baseline implements the Bi et al. (2015) Nature Physics Eq. (2) dimensionless vertex energy `e = 0.5 * sum [(a_i - 1)^2 + r * (p_i - p_0)^2]` and simulates two points (`p_0 = 3.70` solid vs `p_0 = 3.95` fluid), but omits explicit T1 energy barrier `Delta e_T1(p_0)` and shear modulus `G(p_0)` scaling across `p_0^* = 3.813`, omits the Park et al. (2015) Nature Materials non-asthmatic vs. asthmatic human bronchial epithelium ALI maturation timecourse and bronchospasm compression perturbation, does not load or segment the vendored human monolayer micrograph (`human_epithelial_monolayer_specimen.jpg`), and exposes no CLI parameter flags beyond `--self-test`. Overall 54.2/100 (faithfulness 49.1, reproducibility 66.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0cb0132; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 67, Morphological realism / specimen match 34, Parameter expressivity 45, Morphometric validation 53, Source and data traceability 63, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/vertex_glass_jamming_comparison.png: rendered output of 2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py at 0cb0132, image/png, 157153 B, 1560×520 px, artifact_sha256 1b0d09c98454983bc345738c02733c122e65b9963a3d007878775ca67be4b6f5 (sha256 1b0d09c98454983bc345738c02733c122e65b9963a3d007878775ca67be4b6f5), spec_fingerprint 52abc2dcaa2857a7c9b54a7d8ac8d7ebb1e0481dc0dc957ca72fa6bc9190d466. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 52abc2dcaa2857a7c9b54a7d8ac8d7ebb1e0481dc0dc957ca72fa6bc9190d466; artifact_sha256: 1b0d09c98454983bc345738c02733c122e65b9963a3d007878775ca67be4b6f5." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement explicit T1 topological rearrangement energy barrier Delta e_T1(p_0) and static shear modulus G(p_0) scaling across an 8-point p_0 phase sweep spanning solid jammed (p_0 < 3.813) and fluid unjammed (p_0 >= 3.813) regimes, plus a perimeter-elasticity ablation control (r = 0).",
            "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/vertex_glass_jamming/vertex_glass_jamming_reference.json` and `human_epithelial_monolayer_specimen.jpg`, segment the dark junctional boundaries and blue nuclear seeds via watershed/Voronoi tessellation to extract empirical cell shape indices q = P/sqrt(A) and polygon classes P(n), and validate against the k-Gamma distribution.",
            "remediation needed: Model the Park et al. (2015) Nature Materials human bronchial epithelial cell (HBEC) air-liquid interface maturation timecourse (Days 3-18) for non-asthmatic control vs. asthmatic donors and 30 cm H2O mechanical bronchospasm compression, plus Atia et al. (2018) universal k-Gamma shape-index scaling." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.542"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

